    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cutsceneID
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[0].text
      value: Welcome.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[1].text
      value: You must have some resilience to have made it here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[2].text
      value: Good work.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[3].text
      value: But the most brutal trials are to come.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[4].text
      value: There have been many who have made it to the deep sea trenches.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[5].text
      value: But becoming the new champion takes more than that.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[6].text
      value: Let's see if you have it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[7].text
      value: You'll need more urgency than that.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[0].textName
      value: Hello
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6113766745128219339, guid: f3482ec7ac2714a5486faf98a0368822, type: 3}
      propertyPath: frames.Array.data[1].cameraCoords.x
      value: 0
